L6: 2 
L7:  Department of Health Sciences ,  Lehman College of CUNY ,  Bronx ,  New York ,  USA
L8: 3 
L9:  Bayesian Bodybuilding ,  Gorinchem ,  Netherlands
L10: 4 
L11:  Sport Performance Research Institute New Zealand, AUT University ,  Auckland ,  New Zealand
